  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "worthless, lame, trivial",
      "explanation": "Describes something or someone that is not worth attention or effort; disappointing or pathetic."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "09357_shoumonai_ex1",
      "japanese": "しょうもない⟦{冗談|じょうだん}→冗談：03347_joudan⟧だな。",
      "english": "That's a lame joke.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "09357_shoumonai_ex2",
      "japanese": "しょうもないこと⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{喧嘩|けんか}→喧嘩：02996_kenka⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧な。",
      "english": "Don't fight over trivial things.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "09357_shoumonai_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦あいつ→あいつ：08267_aitsu⟧、⟦ほんと→ほんと：08758_honto⟧しょうもない{奴|やつ}だ。",
      "english": "That guy is really pathetic.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "09357_shoumonai_ex4",
      "japanese": "しょうもないこと⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{使|つか}って→使う：00473_tsukau⟧しまった。",
      "english": "I wasted my time on something pointless.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\nFrom ⟦{仕様|しよう}→仕様：00472_shiyou⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧ (\"there is no way to deal with it\"), which came to mean worthless or lame.\n\nREGISTER:\nCasual and dismissive. Especially common in Kansai speech, but used throughout Japan.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- くだらない: stupid, worthless; the standard word, slightly harsher.\n- つまらない: boring, uninteresting; about lack of interest rather than lack of worth.\n- ばからしい: ridiculous, absurd.",
